<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of</p>
<p>four-day Sheffield Shield matches on Monday:</p>
<p>In Adelaide - New South Wales beat South Australia by 143</p>
<p>runs. New South Wales 415 (Corey Richards 76) and 173-3 (Rodney</p>
<p>Davison 67 not out); South Australia 137 and 308 (Darren Lehmann</p>
<p>97, Brad Young 91, Martin Faull 68, Phil Alley five for 89).</p>
<p>In Perth - Western Australia beat Victoria by seven wickets.</p>
<p>Western Australia 495 (Mike Hussey 147, Damien Martyn 108) and</p>
<p>121 for three (Mike Hussey 50); Victoria 332 (Rohan Larkin 104)</p>
<p>and 283 (Graeme Vampini 88, Dean Jones 75).</p>
